          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Crew's Call"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine)\n\nThe crew let out an anguished cry in unison. This is a wail of the banshee spell with 100-foot emanation (39). In addition, any creature within 5 feet of the ship is grabbed by the crew. The ship can't use Crew's Call again for 1d4+1 rounds."
